  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1731\" class=\"elementor elementor-1731\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-32eb9f71 elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"71189\" data-id=\"32eb9f71\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3af8422e\" data-eae-slider=\"8960\" data-id=\"3af8422e\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61feee65 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"61feee65\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1464\" height=\"976\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Lotto-New-Zealand.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-9004\" alt=\"New Zealand PowerBall Lotto\" srcset=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Lotto-New-Zealand.jpg 1464w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Lotto-New-Zealand-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Lotto-New-Zealand-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Lotto-New-Zealand-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1464px) 100vw, 1464px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\"></figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3e9751eb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"40172\" data-id=\"3e9751eb\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3ca3979d\" data-eae-slider=\"47172\" data-id=\"3ca3979d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a637347 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7a637347\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">About the New Zealand Lotto\n</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4099d331 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"17011\" data-id=\"4099d331\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-372336e2\" data-eae-slider=\"5498\" data-id=\"372336e2\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-788e8dfc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"788e8dfc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The </span><b>lottery of New Zealand Lotto</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provides a safe and interactive way for Kiwis to play and gamble while putting money back into the community. It’s formed a crucial part of the organizations and projects across the country.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The maiden draw for the New Zealand Lotto occurred on 22 July 1987 for $360,000. It was a massive success, with Kiwis spending $249 million in the first year alone. By 2008 </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery winners </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">received over $3.75 billion in prize money and $3.6 billion paid out in grants by 2015.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Over the years, the lotto has adapted and changed to keep up with technology and Kiwis’ needs. It’s grown from having one weekly draw to include a Powerball and Strike. Players can also find regular promotions to boost their winning chance.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The release of the </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery app</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> allows Kiwis to save their favorite numbers to play at a local retailer. The app also doubles as a </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to check the results. </span></p><p><br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The focus of the </span><b>lottery of New Zealand Lotto</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> lies with the community, with 100% of profits used to fund over 3,000 projects annually. Some of them include the Sport New Zealand, the New Zealand Film Commission, and the Creative New Zealand organizations.</span></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-39d6514 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"47842\" data-id=\"39d6514\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3e2405f9\" data-eae-slider=\"4047\" data-id=\"3e2405f9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d143031 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6d143031\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">New Zealand Lotto FAQ</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1505323c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-invisible\" data-eae-slider=\"26195\" data-id=\"1505323c\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;motion_fx_motion_fx_scrolling&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;slideInUp&quot;,&quot;motion_fx_devices&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-wider\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-444fc840\" data-eae-slider=\"88830\" data-id=\"444fc840\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d2e6d9d elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"7d2e6d9d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-7d2e6d9d\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"7d2e6d9d\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"can-i-play-online\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2101\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Can I Play Online?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2101\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"can-i-play-online\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Yes, you can. If you visit the New Zealand Lotto website and register an account, you can play  Lotto, Powerball, Strike, Bullseye, Keno, and Instant Kiwi. Unfortunately, Combo isn’t available due to the spending limits of the Responsible Gaming Policy. You can, however, play Combo 8 because it falls within the bracket.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you have a smartphone, try out the </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery app</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">. You can use it to save your favorite numbers, purchase tickets, and it doubles as a </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Remember that playing and ticket purchasing is only available to players 18 years and older. </span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-new-zealand-lottery-drawing\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2102\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the New Zealand Lottery Drawing?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2102\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-new-zealand-lottery-drawing\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">You can watch the </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery numbers</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> live every Wednesday evening at approximately 8:20 PM and Saturday evenings at 8 PM. Get the </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery results</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> from live draws broadcasted on TV One.</span></p><p><br /><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you miss the live draw, don’t worry because you can rewatch it on TVNZ OnDemand. The results of the New Zealand Lotto lottery will also be posted on the website, Facebook, and Twitter. You can also use the </span><b>New Zealand lotto Lottery ticket scanner</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> on the app.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-to-cash-your-new-zealand-lotto-winnings\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2103\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How to cash your New Zealand Lotto winnings?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2103\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"how-to-cash-your-new-zealand-lotto-winnings\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you see the </span><b>results of the New Zealand Lotto Lottery</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> and have the winning numbers, you can visit your nearest retailer (with your ticket) if you bought a paper ticket. Prizes under $1000 will be paid out straight away. For winnings greater than $1000, you’ll complete a Prize Claim Form, and the lottery will pay you.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">If you played online, your winnings of $1000 and less will be added to your MyLotto wallet. If you win a prize of greater value, you need to submit the Online Prize Claim Form. The </span><b>lottery of New Zealand Lotto</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> will pay you out within three working days.</span></p><p> </p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Remember, you have up to 12 months from the draw date to claim your prize.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"do-i-pay-tax-on-my-winnings\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-2104\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Do I Pay Tax On My Winnings?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-2104\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"do-i-pay-tax-on-my-winnings\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">No, </span><b>New Zealand Lotto lottery winners</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> don’t pay tax on their winnings. However, if you choose to invest your prize money, you’ll pay tax on any interest earned.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-22b162de elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"4409\" data-id=\"22b162de\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-eccbfd7\" data-eae-slider=\"45312\" data-id=\"eccbfd7\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-104af0ab elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"104af0ab\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the <b>New Zealand Lotto</b>? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-219a2764\" data-eae-slider=\"35856\" data-id=\"219a2764\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1902bbd0 elementor-align-center elementor-button-success elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"1902bbd0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-lg\" href=\"/Contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Send Us an Email</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a9df91a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"76530\" data-id=\"a9df91a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ebe8846\" data-eae-slider=\"66399\" data-id=\"ebe8846\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc40c98 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"fc40c98\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can I Play Online?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, you can. If you visit the New Zealand Lotto website and register an account, you can play Lotto, Powerball, Strike, Bullseye, Keno, and Instant Kiwi. Unfortunately, Combo isn\\u2019t available due to the spending limits of the Responsible Gaming Policy. You can, however, play Combo 8 because it falls within the bracket.\\n\\nIf you have a smartphone, try out the New Zealand Lotto lottery app. You can use it to save your favorite numbers, purchase tickets, and it doubles as a New Zealand Lotto lottery ticket scanner.\\n\\nRemember that playing and ticket purchasing is only available to players 18 years and older.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When Is the New Zealand Lottery Drawing?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can watch the New Zealand Lotto lottery numbers live every Wednesday evening at approximately 8:20 PM and Saturday evenings at 8 PM. Get the New Zealand Lotto lottery results from live draws broadcasted on TV One.\\n\\n  \\nIf you miss the live draw, don\\u2019t worry because you can rewatch it on TVNZ OnDemand. The results of the New Zealand Lotto lottery will also be posted on the website, Facebook, and Twitter. You can also use the New Zealand lotto Lottery ticket scanner on the app.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How to cash your New Zealand Lotto winnings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"If you see the results of the New Zealand Lotto Lottery and have the winning numbers, you can visit your nearest retailer (with your ticket) if you bought a paper ticket. Prizes under $1000 will be paid out straight away. For winnings greater than $1000, you\\u2019ll complete a Prize Claim Form, and the lottery will pay you.\\n\\nIf you played online, your winnings of $1000 and less will be added to your MyLotto wallet. If you win a prize of greater value, you need to submit the Online Prize Claim Form. The lottery of New Zealand Lotto will pay you out within three working days.\\n\\nRemember, you have up to 12 months from the draw date to claim your prize.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do I Pay Tax On My Winnings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No, New Zealand Lotto lottery winners don\\u2019t pay tax on their winnings. However, if you choose to invest your prize money, you\\u2019ll pay tax on any interest earned.\"}}]}</script>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
